arget":"oq_sensitivity_driven_allocation","relation":"conceptually_related_to","confidence":"INFERRED","confidence_score":0.7,"source_file":"docs/oQ_Quantization.md","source_location":null,"weight":1.0}],"hyperedges":[{"id":"omlx_inference_stack","label":"oMLX Full Inference Stack","description":"The complete inference pipeline: FastAPI server routes to EnginePool (multi-model), which dispatches to specialized engines (BatchedEngine for LLMs, VLMEngine for vision). Scheduler handles FCFS concurrency via mlx-lm BatchGenerator. Cache stack provides tiered KV caching with PagedCacheManager (GPU, block-based, CoW, prefix sharing) + Hot Cache (RAM) + PagedSSDCacheManager (SSD cold tier).","node_ids":["omlx_fastapi_server","omlx_engine_pool","omlx_batched_engine","omlx_vlm_engine","omlx_scheduler","omlx_paged_cache_manager","omlx_paged_ssd_cache_manager","mlxl_mlx_lm"],"confidence":"EXTRACTED","confidence_score":1.0},{"id":"oq_quantization_pipeline","label":"oQ Quantization Pipeline","description":"The oQ system for producing mlx-lm compatible quantized models. Two paths: oQ+ (enhanced) measures per-layer sensitivity via calibration, applies GPTQ weight optimization with MoE batched processing, then mixed-precision quantization. oQ (streaming) processes tensors one at a time via mmap for large models. Both use the same sensitivity-driven bit allocation with mandatory protection for critical tensors.","node_ids":["oq_quantization","oq_sensitivity_driven_allocation","oq_gptq_optimization","oq_moe_batched_gptq","oq_streaming_quantization","oq_calibration_data","gptq_paper"],"confidence":"EXTRACTED","confidence_score":1.0},{"id":"dflash_speculative_decoding_flow","label":"DFlash Speculative Decoding Flow","description":"DFlashEngine integrates block diffusion speculative decoding into oMLX. A small draft model proposes 16 tokens simultaneously (block diffusion, not autoregressive), the target model verifies all in one forward pass, and the longest matching prefix is committed. Falls back to BatchedEngine for long contexts (>=4096 tokens). Does not use oMLX's paged/SSD cache system internally.","node_ids":["dflash_engine","dflash_block_diffusion","dflash_mlx","dflash_fallback_mechanism","dflash_temperature_sampling","omlx_batched_engine","dflash_paper"],"confidence":"EXTRACTED","confidence_score":1.0}],"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}